# Rung 1 v2: the simplest fight. Open ground with a few single
# water tiles, hills in line of sight (distance ~7, sight ~8.8).
# Ants see each other from turn 1. 180-degree rotational symmetry,
# so the map favors no one. Water stays off the central corridor
# and clear of both hills: it adds texture, not walls.
rows 12
cols 16
players 2
